{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐细节和情绪转折颗粒度不如X，尤其缺少随具体乐句出现的细微变化，部分感受被概括成了较笼统的心理状态。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏让叙事和感受各有位置，普通观众可以先抓住人物正在经历什么，再扫右侧的感受，不容易被大量碎片信息打断。Y的叙述也更充分地交代了人物从害怕暴露心意、因为对方没有退开而放松，到渴望互相依靠、又害怕失去的心理因果，前后转变比较连贯。X的重点加亮更利于迅速抓住每段核心，而且音乐感受更细致，特别是标记出现时机的短语，能呈现乐句内部的微妙变化；但整体信息密度偏高，部分细节会争夺注意力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "58e3fa2a-1f46-4f6d-b7af-c517fdc7b06a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T061531399008Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:16:42.713079+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a9171196d831bb7fae7c121acb47ee055e32392be36dd92e234c05dafb900b10", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools